# 17. The final master specification

If I were defining SARVAGYA's permanent product direction, I would use the following specification.

# SARVAGYA AI OS

Universal AI • Connected knowledge • Personal intelligence • Reliable automation

1\. Intelligence Core

A shared orchestration layer for reasoning, model selection, tool use and response validation.

2\. Live Intelligence Engine

Authorized web search, connected data sources, scheduled ingestion, source tracking and fresh information retrieval.

3\. Memory & Knowledge Engine

Conversation context, approved user memory, project memory, document retrieval and knowledge relationships.

4\. Agent & Automation Engine

Multi-step planning, background jobs, schedules, approval workflows, retries and durable task state.

